  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Find the value of $\\sqrt[3]{63}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{63}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{63}.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we re-write the product using the cube:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{63}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{63}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{63}={(\\sqrt[3]{63})}^{3}.\n$$\n\nNow, recall that the cube and the cube root cancel each other out. So, we have\n\n$$\n{(\\sqrt[3]{63})}^{3}=63.\n$$",
